   "design": "Patients book and reschedule online, so fewer booking calls come in. Reminders come from the practice system: the aide checks the next day's reminders and releases them once, and phones only patients without a mobile number. The stock list holds reorder points and drafts the supply order from the count, which the aide checks and sends. Referral and insurer forms fill from the practice record instead of copying details by hand; the aide checks the claims and sends them once from the treatment record. Phones for other matters, counting, restocking, the desk and filing stay with the aide.",
   "previous_blocker": "Bookings, reminders, orders and forms were all done by hand.",
   "enabler_now": "Online booking with reminders, reorder points and forms filled from the record.",
   "still_hard": "Patients who will not use online booking.",
   "human_edge": "Calming an anxious patient at the desk.",
